      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HEY ZIPPER (3) finished well back at The Gardens last time when a 8 length eighth (23.84) but scored four back at The Gardens (22.71). Won at her only start from this draw. Tough to beat if on-song. HANDS ON TINA (8) is a promising dog in the frame at five of 10 starts including three wins and was in the minors again latest (22.63) over 388m at this track. Tends to go well on this box draw. Super consistent and can feature with the right run. ULTIMATE SIN (1) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 6th at Richmond following on from a third place finish (22.96) there the start prior. Goes very well here at the trip finding the frame in each of three starts. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. HI LO RAIN (2) cannot be left out over a shorter distance.",
